---
// src/pages/about.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us - Free Bulk Image Downloader"
  description="Learn about the philosophy and mission behind our free client-side Bulk Image Downloader. Fast, secure, and extension-free."
  keywords="about bulk image downloader, client-side image downloader, secure bulk downloader"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="relative overflow-hidden pt-12 pb-20 border-b border-hairline bg-canvas rounded-lg mb-12"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 -top-40 -left-40 h-[600px] w-[800px] mesh-gradient pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-[500px] w-[500px] mesh-gradient pointer-events-none"
      style="opacity: 0.08;"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center px-4">
      <span
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-link-bg-soft px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-link mb-6"
      >
        💡 Our Philosophy
      </span>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-6 font-sans"
      >
        About Bulk Image Downloader
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-lg md:text-xl text-body mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        A high-performance, private, client-side utility designed to simplify asset gathering for creators and developers worldwide.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Detailed content section -->
  <section class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto mb-20">
    <div class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4 font-sans">
          Why we built this tool
        </h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Finding and downloading multiple image assets for web development, design work, machine learning training, or content creation is often a repetitive and frustrating task. While browser extensions exist, they frequently request excessive permissions—such as the ability to read and change all your data on every website you visit.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
          We believed there had to be a better, safer, and faster way. We developed <strong>Bulk Image Downloader</strong> as a 100% client-side web application. It runs directly in your browser, keeping your workflow secure, private, and independent of browser extension stores.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-hairline pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-6 font-sans">
          Core values & design principles
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="border border-hairline rounded p-5 bg-canvas-soft-2">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🔒</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Privacy First</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
              We never upload your URLs, crawled pages, or downloaded images to any server. All processing, filtering, and ZIP generation happens directly inside your browser memory.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-hairline rounded p-5 bg-canvas-soft-2">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">⚡</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">High Performance</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
              Using modern browser APIs, we fetch, preview, and compress hundreds of images concurrently to save you time. No artifical limitations, no paywalls.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-hairline rounded p-5 bg-canvas-soft-2">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🎨</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Zero Bloat</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
              No software installations, no system extensions, and no tracking cookies. Just a clean, premium, and responsive user experience that gets out of your way.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-hairline pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4 font-sans">
          How it works under the hood
        </h2>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
          When you submit a URL list, our script fetches each image asynchronously. For webpage scraping, we utilize browser-native parsing or a secure serverless CORS proxy to retrieve HTML, extract layout elements, find image tags, and feed them into our interactive layout where you can sort and filter by size and type.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
          Finally, we compile your selected assets into a structured ZIP archive in-memory using highly-optimized JavaScript compression libraries, initiating a native download instantly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Have any suggestions or questions?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute">We'd love to hear your feedback on how we can improve our utilities.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="rounded-pill bg-primary px-6 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-on-primary hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors shrink-0"
        >
          Contact Support
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
